nction ‘<em>f</em> ’ = 1 only when <em>X</em> > <em>Y</em> otherwise ‘0’. Then the value of output <em>f</em> is equal to</p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/b9662249d6c5afe3f8d37e13ca7c0994043a1eb8.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/04823c565c7af89266a11ed52960f151c6a95c75.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/73ec441d4ed4e307375d3d87504b24b0fd8e74fe.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/0f971f754ac5e7d993804fac1fe717d52c7bb71d.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>\n (c)</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/1056fb32d07af08257a76ae2f4b4589327eba310.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":16,"type":"MCQ","correct":"A","right":1,"wrong":0.33,"qtext":"<p>\n For the given digital circuit below, having cascade combination of 40 XNOR gates with shown input, then output at the end of 39th XNOR gate will be _______ .</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/a3ac39b27a135f1c9145e5ddad30bef9c6fe3556.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div> <p>\n <em>X<br />\n </em></p></div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/d97cab234790dc5379a89229dcf3e47a8694a5da.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> 0</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> 1</div>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>\n (a)</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/54d5699dfd0caa32810702d3e217d31c10bbc1f1.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":17,"type":"NAT","correct":"","right":2,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>\n Consider the following arithmetic equation</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/c856171a3ad8bbde4826cc9753d7f51b2f4eeaed.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p>\n The minimum possible non-zero base for the given system is ________ .</p></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"4","high":"4"},"solution":"<p>\n 4</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/7a8a4886dc6defeb931bba28fc47d849df169591.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"}],"questionCount":17,"parsedAt":"2026-11-10T19:39:11.864Z"}